# SE-007: Distillation rejects a nonvolatile salt but may carry a volatile acid
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaCl 0.005mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CH3COOH 0.005mol
new
new
distil v1 v3 0.2 stages 3
distil v2 v4 0.2 stages 3
measure v3 ph
measure v4 ph
measure v3 conductivity
measure v4 conductivity
inspect
